# Fusion OS package additions (appended to the archiso releng list).
# Target: a weak x86-64 laptop/PC. Lean gaming stack, no heavy desktop.
# IMPORTANT: pacman package lists take ONE bare package name per line.
# No inline comments on a package line -- they must be on their own line.

# --- Graphics drivers: open stack for all common GPUs ---
mesa
lib32-mesa
vulkan-icd-loader
lib32-vulkan-icd-loader
vulkan-radeon
lib32-vulkan-radeon
vulkan-intel
lib32-vulkan-intel
vulkan-nouveau
mesa-utils
libva-mesa-driver

# --- Gaming runtime ---
steam
gamescope
mangohud
lib32-mangohud
gamemode
lib32-gamemode
wine
wine-gecko
wine-mono
winetricks
vkd3d
lib32-vkd3d

# --- Controllers / input ---
# (DualShock 4 works via in-kernel hid-sony; xpadneo is AUR -- see iso/README)

# --- System / performance ---
zram-generator
power-profiles-daemon
irqbalance

# --- Preinstalled apps (launched on demand, NOT during setup) ---
firefox
discord
flatpak

# --- Install-to-disk ---
archinstall

# --- Base niceties ---
python
htop
nano
sudo
networkmanager
bluez
bluez-utils
